FILE: vUX-autoWriter.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
stop() already cleared the four timers, so the timer half of teardown existed; what was
missing was the DOM. writeText() injects a '.vAutoWriter' span and, when the cursor is
enabled, a '.vAutoWriterBlinker' span into each target, and reset() nulls the box list,
so after a run nothing knew which elements had been written into. Every target is now
recorded in managedBoxes as addSpan() touches it, and destroy() clears the spans out of
all of them. writeText()/deleteText() now refuse to run on a destroyed instance.

